{"game": "mass-effect-andromeda", "language": "english", "appid": 1238000, "month": "2025-10", "window": 3, "start_date": 1760572800, "end_date": 1761263999, "month_true_total": 96, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-07 22:02:18 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "207402371", "author": {"steamid": "76561198095691048", "personaname": "Reizo", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/reizo9/", "num_games_owned": 118, "num_reviews": 27, "playtime_forever": 113, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 113, "last_played": 1761240726, "avatar": "d14645546aa28d854d44331936a79f1b8f2b7eac"}, "language": "english", "review": "The game has great visuals and spaceish vibes, but it lacks \"quality\" so to speak. Feels a bit \"cheap\" for me at least, kind of Warframe meets Star Trek thing. Its too much of a casual gaming style for my taste, so if you are into space vibes and chill buy it.", "timestamp_created": 1761240962, "timestamp_updated": 1761241624, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "207391202", "author": {"steamid": "76561198334127537", "personaname": "louise.s", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198334127537/", "num_games_owned": 77, "num_reviews": 11, "playtime_forever": 23062, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 18009, "last_played": 1786764478, "avatar": "0ec9c398cffbab74248ef4e916e75cd8c2eb000d"}, "language": "english", "review": "I love the game.  I understand some of the things people have complained about, but it's different, the story moves forward I think, with some nice touches to remember the earlier ME games.  The Architects terrified me at first, but eventually I was able to take them on and even look forward to the battles.  The new \"bad guys\" are kind of like the geth, same general story line, but I can put that aside and just enjoy the new places and getting to drive the Nomad myself. The character friendships and conflicts are similar to real life conflicts between people who have to work together.  Anyway, I'm glad I purchased it.", "timestamp_created": 1761231770, "timestamp_updated": 1761231770, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "207389730", "author": {"steamid": "76561198013110654", "personaname": "BubbleBelly", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198013110654/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 10, "playtime_forever": 2297, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2297, "last_played": 1737419423, "avatar": "56b2c9e9a4948a35819b8f9ea2140fd95263cfc6"}, "language": "english", "review": "This game gets a lot of hate and I don't get why. Is it the best mass effect game ever? No, but that doesn't mean it's not a fun game in its own right. I really quite enjoyed this game more than I thought I would. I'd recommend anyone to pick it up and just enjoy it for what it is, a space shoot 'em up with cool stuff.", "timestamp_created": 1761230533, "timestamp_updated": 1761230533, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "207366137", "author": {"steamid": "76561199121628229", "personaname": "enby666", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199121628229/", "num_games_owned": 54, "num_reviews": 6, "playtime_forever": 2704, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2704, "last_played": 1761201375, "avatar": "ae540d37eef3cfcff194166b7325340a698fe0e0"}, "language": "english", "review": "Great Game", "timestamp_created": 1761201704, "timestamp_updated": 1761201704, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "207363740", "author": {"steamid": "76561198136200686", "personaname": "IronRavenXIX", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198136200686/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 42, "playtime_forever": 4092, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 4092, "last_played": 1761197154, "avatar": "29ad019c826bc797e62a3ec02b4cfb08d1c563cb"}, "language": "english", "review": "Just finished my first run of the game. would I do another? maybe? Perhaps? BUT, I can vouch for the good story. it seems questionable at times, as it does have it's quirks. Still, I enjoyed the game-play and story. It may not come close to the previous games, but Andromeda does have its own charm.", "timestamp_created": 1761197713, "timestamp_updated": 1761197713, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": []}]}